          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.40.050:block:1",
          "start": 757
        },
        "quote": "(b) The insurance requirements of this section shall not apply to contractors who are constructing work for the City under contracts where they have been required to submit public liability and property damage insurance similar to that called for within this section. (Code 1981 § 16-102. Code 1995 § 70-149.)",
